in a small sleepy oregon town jacob  pierce was turning 10 years old his  friends and family had gathered for a  birthday party in their local park it  had all the makings of a perfect day for  a young boy entering the double digits  for the first time there was a hired  magician attempting to make balloon  animals as children loudly mocked him  there was cake ice cream and an ice  cream cake for those who couldn't make  up their mind about which they'd rather  have there were pizzas pepperoni and  cheese and bowl after bowl of chips  jacob was having the best day ever as he  blew out the candles on his birthday  cake he quietly wished for something  amazing to happen it was already a good  day but it was also a little mundane a  fan of science fiction and fantasy jacob  had always quietly hoped that turning 10  would usher in an era of magic and  mystery perhaps he would encounter  aliens for the first time maybe he would  solve a grand mystery or learn about a  civilization of tiny people living in  his backyard or maybe  just maybe he would wake up to find he  had acquired magical powers suddenly he  would cease to be an ordinary young boy  who had to worry about math homework and  playground bullies he would instead  become something special someone who  could change the world around him and  finally make a difference just like the  heroes of all of his favorite books so  as his mother set the cake down in front  of him and everyone sang happy birthday  with loud off-key enthusiasm jacob  closed his eyes and wished little did he  know that his wish was about to come  true at least it sort of was after cake  it was time for every kid's favorite  part of their birthday party the  presents a stack of colorfully wrapped  packages sat on the picnic table just  waiting to be unwrapped jacob bounced  excitedly waiting for his mother to give  the all clear she gathered all the kids  and jacob's 19 year old brother nathan  and instructed them to sit down and  watch jacob open his gifts he tore the  paper from board games action figures  and an ill-advised stuffed animal or two  when suddenly nathan produced a package  he hadn't seen before it was a lumpy  item wrapped in green paper he handed it  to jacob who thrilled to be receiving a  special present from his beloved older  brother immediately opened it there was  a toy dart gun already loaded with a  large foam dart overcome with excitement  jacob jumped up from his seat and asked  if he could play with it now his mother  said it was fine and jacob and his  friends immediately jumped into action  they ran across the park as jacob aimed  the dart gun and decided which target to  fire at it as he squeezed the trigger  aiming for his best friend trevor nathan  called out to him don't shoot at him he  yelled with sudden urgency startled  jacob moved at the last minute and the  dart fired at a nearby stone wall  instead of its original nine-year-old  target as soon as the dart hit the wall  it transformed into a wobbly stack of  large stones the stones tumbled down  landing on several people standing  nearby a man who had been leaning on the  wall fell to the ground where his leg  was crushed under a falling stone the  magician who was packing up his supplies  took a rock to the head and was  immediately knocked unconscious the park  broke into pandemonium people running  and screaming trying to figure out how a  previously solid wall had turned into  falling rocks nathan scooped up jacob  the gun and the dart and pulled him away  from the chaos someone called the police  where an embedded scp foundation  operative was alerted to the situation  unfolding before jacob and his family  could vacate the park two scp operatives  were already arriving on the scene after  speaking with several eyewitnesses they  identified the source of the anomalous  activity as the toy gun and seized it  for further investigation all witnesses  including jacob and his mother were  given amnestics in order to erase their  memory of the toy gun and the incident  in the park nathan pierce who was  considered a person of interest for his  initial possession of the gun could not  be found he fled detention and  foundation custody further indicating  his knowledge of the gun's anomalous  properties and possibly indicating he  was responsible for its creation his  online activity linked him to an  organization satirically called gamers  against weed a group of interests that  had previously been linked to other  anomalies seized by the foundation his  younger brother jacob had without any  knowledge received a birthday gift that  would later become designated  scp-3108  scp-3108 is a modified nerf brand dart  gun that when paired with its foam dart  ammunition designated scp-3108-1  demonstrates anomalous transformative  properties when it fires other nerf  darts it behaves like any ordinary toy  and the same goes for the dart when  fired from any other nerf gun the only  notable difference between scp-3108  and any other ordinary toy dart gun is  the writing on the side which reads op  please nerf in red ink when  scp-3108 is fired at an object it will  immediately be transformed or altered in  a way that turns it into a worse version  of itself this can range anywhere from  small changes to complete transformation  on a molecular scale the law of  conservation of mass does not apply to  these changes and the gun's effects  appear to defy the laws of physics the  transformed objects are not themselves  anomalous in any way and the changes  they undergo appear to be influenced not  by objective reality but by the opinion  of whoever wields the gun whatever the  person firing  scp-3108 thinks would make the target  worse is what comes to pass an external  examination of scp-3108 revealed that it  is made of a steel outer shell with  decorative bronze inlays it can be  physically damaged but resists any  attempts to take it apart security  officer silva attempted to take it apart  with his hands during a round of tests  but before he could break open the shell  he found his hands had transformed into  a pair of rubber gloves they hung limp  and useless from his wrists as he  flopped them around yelling for  assistance officer silva was promptly  placed on leave and no more attempts to  disassemble  scp-3108 has been made since aside from  this one instance  scp-3108 does not have any effect on  objects that are not directly hit by its  star a variety of tests were performed  headed by dr johnson and dr dietz in  order to further examine the anomalous  properties of scp-3108  first a traditional dartboard made of  sissil fibers was set up on the wall of  the lab when hit with  scp-3108 the dartboard changed to a cork  board of the same shape and size filled  with several small holes and bearing a  noticeable beer stain a piece of 8x11  printer paper was transformed into a  square of single ply toilet paper a  sturdy coffee mug from the on-site  cafeteria changed into a small tea cup  made of the same kind of ceramic a  dollar changed into a fake 100 bill from  the board game monopoly it was  determined that the gun's effects are  determined by the personal preference of  the person firing it when it was fired  at a can of coke they can immediately  turned into a can of pepsi much to the  dismay of security officer mike who was  observing the experiment and who  preferred pepsi he took the gun next and  fired it at the can which promptly  turned back into coke on another day of  trials a vhs tape of the 1971 film willy  wonka and the chocolate factory was  transformed into a dvd copy of the 2005  remake of the same film prompting the  research team to wonder does the gun  have a sense of humor it seems so next  the research team began conducting  trials on living organisms a rat was  transformed into an ant which dr dietz  found confusing a female golden  retriever was turned into a female  american shorthair cat unusually large  at a weight of 15.4 kilograms and  displaying behavior more consistent with  that of a dog after rats and dogs the  team decided to move forward into human  trials a 28 year old male was hit with  the gun and promptly turned into a  living specimen of homo neanderthalensis  right before the research team's eyes he  regressed into a real live neanderthal  after this trial the team decided to see  how dangerous the gun could be if pushed  to the limits security officer gardner  was handed  scp-3108 and ordered to fire the gun  repeatedly reloading each time until  told to stop a 24 year old man was  instructed to stand in the firing range  and remain still first he transformed  into a prehistoric man then an  unidentified species of given and next a  three-toed sloth on nine occasions of  the gun being fired the subject did not  change species but rather took on  physical signs of injury or disease  after 46 shots testing was finally  stopped after the subject was reduced to  a small variety of earthworm after  attempting to track him down  unsuccessfully for months nathan pierce  was finally located by foundation  personnel and apprehended at an internet  cafe in los angeles california he was  taken into custody and brought to site  64 for questioning about the creation of  scp-3108  dr deeds conducted the interview and  asked why nathan created the gun nathan  referred to it as the nerfing gun and  explained that he thought it would be  funny it didn't have any particularly  grand purpose or intention it was just  something he had come up with and  thought it would be entertaining he  experimented with it for a while got  bored of it and then gave it to his  brother as a gift his only regret was  not giving his brother a proper warning  on how to use it before doing so dr  dietz applied a little pressure  insisting that the anomaly was dangerous  and could turn people into invertebrates  this stopped the interview cold as  nathan became visibly distressed he  insisted that it was never intended to  be used on people but for low-level  mischief he concluded the interview by  saying why would you turn a joke into a  torture device and demanded that dr  dietz leave his cell and stop speaking  to him nathan pierce was later released  from custody and the containment  procedures for  scp-3108 were updated with this new  information in mind  scp-3108 is contained in the standard  anomalous containment vault in site-64  and is not allowed to be removed from  said vault except for use in experiments  proposed testing must be approved by dr  johnson and dr deeds before it can be  conducted the gun may not be stored  while loaded and the foam dart is stored  in a separate containment vault during  any and all testing  scp-3108 is only to be handled by  security staff only one officer may hold  and fire the object at a time while a  secondary officer observes and watches  for potential accidents or any  unapproved use of the item researchers  and d-class personnel are not permitted  to fire the gun due to concerns about  safety and security it may not be used  under any circumstances in cross testing  with other scp objects it is also  forbidden from use in any testing on  humanoids as this is now considered an  ethics violation how would you use the  nerfing gun if it ever fell into your  hands and what do you think would happen  let us know down in the comments or  we'll shoot and make your comments  terrible now go check out irresistible  pickup artist  scp-3512 the more you know and top 8 scp  objects you actually want for more dark  and often hilarious anomalies
 

